ekinesis (physical) is the catalog Telekinesis. || SKILLS: skills of note as occ_skills, each at catalog base +15%: basic math 45, advanced math 45, biology 30, chemistry 30, holistic medicine 20, demon and monster lore 25, land (and underwater) navigation 36 at 4 per level, wilderness survival 30. Dragonese/Elf and four other languages are printed without a percentage, stored at the catalog base (judgement). No related or secondary skills: the book grants none. || PROWL: the entry states prowl 60% and, two sentences later, a regular prowl of 50%; both are in the prose. || Alignment (any, almost always diabolic or miscreant), weight (one ton), size (8 to 12 ft tall, about 8 ft long), NPC level (5th, occasionally 7th) and life span (3000 years) are in the body."
